          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 686,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.430:block:1",
          "start": 463
        },
        "quote": "(b) There shall be an administrative penalty of $100.00 imposed on the owner for each violation of subsection (a) of this section that remains uncorrected after the time period stated in the notice of violation has elapsed.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.430:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.65.430 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "2fe339cf-6f00-5cd0-94dc-05bb69f33f23",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1637,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.430:block:2",
          "start": 687
        },
        "quote": "(c) Abatement. Upon the expiration of the compliance period stated in the notice of violation, the Code Official shall inspect the property. The Code Official may grant an extension of time if the owner demonstrates that due diligence is being exercised in abating the violation. If the owner has failed to comply within the compliance period or has failed to timely request an appeal hearing, the Code Official may abate the violation and assess the costs against the owner. If the payment of costs is not made within 30 days from the date of the notice of costs, the City may levy a special assessment against the property. The City Clerk, at the time of certifying other City taxes, shall certify the costs and the County Clerk shall extend the same on the tax roll of the county against the property. Additionally, the City may collect the costs in the manner provided by K.S.A. 12-1,115 , as amended, by bringing an action in the district court.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.65.430:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
